WEBVTT

00:10.010 --> 00:16.625
[opening theme music]

03:59.543 --> 04:03.112
[bittersweet music]

04:13.992 --> 04:15.820
[door opens then closes]

06:22.120 --> 06:27.343
[hubbub of voices]

07:42.331 --> 07:45.508
[bottles shatter]

07:50.687 --> 07:52.515
[action music]

09:38.795 --> 09:43.234
[mysterious music]

12:18.650 --> 12:21.305
[sweet melodic music]

13:42.082 --> 13:44.954
[soft violin music]

15:45.118 --> 15:48.208
[mysterious music]

16:14.886 --> 16:17.280
[music continues]

16:17.454 --> 16:24.026
[alarm ringing]

16:49.617 --> 16:52.489
[music continues]

17:31.833 --> 17:33.748
[radar beeping]

18:21.361 --> 18:23.754
[action music]

18:31.240 --> 18:32.807
[explosion]

20:00.199 --> 20:03.071
[all groaning]

21:10.965 --> 21:14.534
[melodic music]

21:58.491 --> 22:00.667
[music continues]

22:52.980 --> 22:59.813
[ending theme music]
